{
  "name": "dsh-redpet",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "红队小队员 —— 网络安全红队主题的桌面宠物：超变形 Q 版蓝毛小队员，亮红色连体工装 + 悬浮全息键盘。踩点/打点/收工全程陪你干活，闲下来会念叨战况。基于 dsh-pet 0.3.5 改造，动作精简到 10 个。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "desktop-pet",
    "pet",
    "redteam",
    "cybersecurity",
    "floating-widget",
    "web-ui",
    "cordis",
    "react"
  ],
  "_comment": [
    "=============== dsh-redpet 包清单说明 ===============",
    "血统：本包的宿主半侧 / 浏览器半侧 / 渲染与投递机制，是从 dsh-pet 0.3.5（MIT，作者 PC2005-cloud）的构建产物改造而来：",
    "  · 全局把标识 dsh-pet 改名为 dsh-redpet（路由前缀、用户数据目录、CSS 类名、槽位键、日志前缀）",
    "  · assets/config.jsonc 重写为「10 个动作 + 红队人设/台词」",
    "  · 删掉了 standalone CLI（bin/lib/standalone.js）——本包只做插件，不提供独立模式",
    "main: lib/index.js —— 宿主半侧入口（Cordis 插件：name/inject/apply）",
    "exports['./client'] —— 浏览器半侧入口，DSH 模块系统按它提供 /plugins/dsh-redpet/client.js",
    "dsh.bundle.patch —— 声明本包是 bundle，patch 文件是 cordis.patch.yml",
    "dsh.client —— 声明浏览器半侧的注入依赖和平台（web）",
    "cordis.patch.yml 里 id 必须与包名一致：id: dsh-redpet",
    "用户数据目录：$DSH_HOME/dsh-redpet/（与 dsh-pet 完全分开，互不读对方）",
    "dependencies —— 运行时依赖；桌面模式（Electron 透明窗）用到，浏览器模式用不到，但 lib/index.js 顶层 import 了它们，不能删",
    "peerDependencies —— 运行时由宿主（DSH）提供，本包不打包它们",
    "================================================"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/types/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "types": "./lib/types/client/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "assets/webm",
    "assets/fonts",
    "assets/pic",
    "assets/memes",
    "assets/config.jsonc",
    "runtime/electron-helper",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.12.0"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@electron-internal/extract-zip": "^1.0.5",
    "@electron/get": "^5.1.0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "compatibility": {
      "dshReleases": {
        "0.2.0-rc.1": "compatible",
        "0.2.0-rc.2": "compatible"
      }
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.4",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-default-model": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-commands": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-credentials": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-home-paths": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-webserver": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "react": "^18.2.0",
    "react-dom": "^18.2.0"
  }
}
